<script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/interface/NewsvoteDWR.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/engine.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/news/newscontent.js"></script><LINK href="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/photoswipe.css" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/pw.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/ajax.js"></script><form name="_newscontent_fromname">
<div style="min-height:300px;">
    <h1 align="center">“筑梦活动”——征集学生梦想，促进学生发展</h1>
    <div align="center" style="line-height:60px;color:#aaa;">时间：2025-05-15&nbsp;&nbsp;阅读次数：<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1370093333, 12524)</script>&nbsp;</div>
    <div id="vsb_content" style="line-height:24px;"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Cambria;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #1F497D;  --docx-lt2-color: #EEECE1;  --docx-accent1-color: #4F81BD;  --docx-accent2-color: #C0504D;  --docx-accent3-color: #9BBB59;  --docx-accent4-color: #8064A2;  --docx-accent5-color: #4BACC6;  --docx-accent6-color: #F79646;  --docx-hlink-color: #0000FF;  --docx-folhlink-color: #800080;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: Times New Roman;}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: Calibri;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}.docx table, table.docx_2 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}</style><p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt; white-space: pre-wrap;"> &nbsp;为破解大学生“成长迷茫症”，激发自我发展意识，引导大学生认真思考大学期间的发展规划，探索精准育人新模式，西安电子科技大学党委学生工作部/学生工作处于3月至5月面向全体本科生开展“筑梦活动”。学校通过各大媒体平台转发通知、在校园张贴海报等营造全员参与氛围。在“筑梦活动”牵引下，辅导员通过主题征文、主题晚点名、就业指导课等各种渠道引导学生说出自己的梦想、畅想发展路径，掌握</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt; white-space: pre-wrap;">并帮助学生完善目标规划。</span></p><section class="docx"><article><p style="line-height: 1; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 431.8pt; height: 189.55pt;"><img src="/__local/C/D1/CB/43FD5E170143AB448029000A73C_7C5D1DBF_110DE.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/CD1CB43FD5E170143AB448029000A73C/7C5D1DBF/110DE" vheight=" 189.55pt" vwidth=" 431.8pt" orisrc="/__local/4/23/38/8AC9DA3A2381550B17B56149C76_FBC14FED_2DBCA.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 431.8pt; height: 189.55pt;"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">“筑梦活动</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">”梦想图谱分析及“金字塔三位一体式成长引育行动”概念图</span></p><p style="line-height: 1; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 432pt; height: 182.25pt;"><img src="/__local/7/FB/B5/2F31F38F487842756556E494E8F_D1E8CBD9_54566.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/7FBB52F31F38F487842756556E494E8F/D1E8CBD9/54566" vheight=" 182.25pt" vwidth=" 432pt" orisrc="/__local/D/4C/4A/0C0A30BFB376EFCE0E9B0EE4AFD_081F7B72_A3B618.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 432pt; height: 182.25pt;"></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 7.85pt; line-height: 1; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">实施</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">发展型资助育人计划</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，助力学生成长发展</span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 7.85pt; line-height: 1; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 431.95pt; height: 255.9pt;"><img src="/__local/7/15/53/BBE290777C4580A6877D881E766_2EE2E8E8_2389E.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/71553BBE290777C4580A6877D881E766/2EE2E8E8/2389E" vheight=" 255.9pt" vwidth=" 431.95pt" orisrc="/__local/8/19/14/E0D3CDF0DBD7EB64017E0A380A2_1EF7A901_A2E62.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 431.95pt; height: 255.9pt;"></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 7.85pt; line-height: 1; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">多途径宣讲青春人物成长故事</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，身边典型激发学子发展意识</span></p><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 32pt; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学校对征集到的近千份材料进行“梦想图谱分析”，梳理出困惑咨询类、学习规划类、实践拓展类、综合发展类四大类“学生梦想”。在此基础上，建立“学生发展需求与成长资源供给”相匹配的资助育人路径，线上通过“AI成长助手”置入标准化解题知识库、国奖人物和青春人物成长故事、校友发展案例等，实现“7×24小时”智能诊断、答疑解惑、个性化案例推送。线下实施“FAST”发展型资助育人计划，构建“学术赋能-实践拓展-能力训练”的三维支持网络，邀请“学术达人”来校讲座交流、开展行走课堂”赴企业或科研院所实践访学、开设“笃行班”进行学生“听说读写”四方面能力提升训练等，分层分类、多形式多维度提供个性化帮扶指导，全力帮扶学生成长发展。下一步，学校将分期开展“筑梦活动”，持续征集学生梦想，营造“人人都有梦想，个个都在成长”良好氛围，并持续通过“金字塔三位一体式成长引育行动”进一步助力学生发展。</span></p><p style="line-height: 1; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 413pt; height: 264.25pt;"><img src="/__local/7/07/12/F692A8704E8AC656B96BD1113C5_A3CC6FD8_542DA.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/70712F692A8704E8AC656B96BD1113C5/A3CC6FD8/542DA" vheight=" 264.25pt" vwidth=" 413pt" orisrc="/__local/2/3C/32/4937BA0043DECE90372512A20EB_5D2CB11A_129685.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 413pt; height: 264.25pt;"></span></span></p><p style="min-height: 25pt; line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 32pt; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">“筑梦活动”也在学生和家长群体中引发广泛讨论，学生和家长电话询问撰写方式、寻求指导，还在推文下留言道：“梦想不是空想，而是人生蓝图。从明确目标到步步积累，如同搭建积木，夯实基础，才能筑起成功的高塔。愿我们都能实现心中的梦想。”“希望孩子静下心来好好规划一下大学四年的人生，大学如旷野，给孩子提供了很多可能性，愿他们都能找到目标，奋发有为，加油吧！”等等。</span></p><p style="line-height: 1; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></article></section><p><br></p><p><br></p>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
